.th BIO VI 5/31/77
.sh NAME
bio \*- biorhythm analysis
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd /usr/games/bio
birth-date start-date [ number-of-days ]
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Bio
produces a graph of a person's biorhythm functions.
The date arguments are given in the form
mm/dd/yy.
The
.it number-of-days
argument is the number of days for which the
graph is printed.
The default is 30 days.
The three biorhythm curves are plotted:
physical (p), emotional (e), and intellectual (i).
.s1
To get a neatly formatted graph quickly use:
.nf
       bio birth-date start-date ^ reform ^ pr ^ gsi
.fi
